$pregnant_slave_taken[5] = '  [REVEREND BLANCHETT]<br>- You pretend or actually forgot the code, hm? According to our code, all future mothers of Rome who have been pregnant for more than 4 months are to be delivered to the church.'
$pregnant_slave_taken[6] = '  [<<$master_name>>]<br>- I did not forget that. But you want to take my property. And I may have plans for the child.'
$pregnant_slave_taken[7] = '  [REVEREND BLANCHETT]<br>- God rarely allows new souls to appear right in Rome. Especially since this is not possible without special rituals. Without our guardianship your baby will be born without a soul and will die soon.'
$pregnant_slave_taken[8] = '  [REVEREND BLANCHETT]<br>- As for the slave, we will bring her back as soon as she recovers.'
$pregnant_slave_taken[9] = '  [<<$master_name>>]<br>- But I lose time. And time is money, especially in our business. What if she dies during childbirth? Can you guarantee that I will get her back?'
$pregnant_slave_taken[10] = '  [REVEREND BLANCHETT]<br>- We know how to support a mother in labour, <<$master_name>>. Much better than you do, by the way. But I understand your concerns. I am authorized to redeem your slave at the current market price - <<ransom>> sparks.'
$pregnant_slave_taken[11] = '  [<<$master_name>>]<br>- Firstly, her training has not been completed. Secondly, in my opinion, she is more expensive. And thirdly…'
$pregnant_slave_taken[12] = '  [REVEREND BLANCHETT]<br>- And thirdly, I have been authorized to use force to anyone who hides unborn children from the Church’s salvation!!!'
$pregnant_slave_taken[13] = '  [REVEREND BLANCHETT]<br>- So let’s finish this bargain. In the end, we are so much alike: like slavers, ministers of the Church dedicate our lives to teach the servants of God humility. Do not make me give YOU a lesson.'
$pregnant_slave_taken[14] = '  [<<$master_name>>]<br>- You leave me no choice. So be it. Take her and go.'
$pregnant_slave_taken[15] = '  [REVEREND BLANCHETT]<br>- Amen. Here are your sparks, <<$master_name>>. Thank you for your cooperation!'
!PREGNANT female TAKEN
$coach_teaches = '  The tutor works with your slave for two academic hours and then gives a progress report…'

$secretary_coach = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- What kind of student do you offer me this time, <<$master_name>>? Note that with my experience, I could teach even a monkey complex fractions, but the better the student’s motivation is, the fewer lessons are needed.'
$service_coach = '  [MASTER JEEVES]<br>- There are a thousand different important details and secrets in cleaning and other household affairs. But among them one is most important - diligence. I’ll teach your slave all of this, <<$master_name>>.'
$cook_coach = '  [MASTER JEEVES]<br>- Cooking is a high art, and I am convinced that men are better at it than women, <<$master_name>>. However, I will try to teach your slave to cook a variety of tasty dishes with just a few recipes. It’s easy.'
$nurse_coach = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- Of course, we can’t prepare a doctor of medicine in this short amount of time, <<$master_name>>. But I can turn your slave into a qualified nurse. With due perseverance and ability, she will learn the profession very quickly.'
$stamina_coach = '  [MASTER GERALD]<br>- Good health and physical fitness is important for any slave, <<$master_name>>. It is good that you called me. I’ll train her relentlessly and will achieve good results, even if she tries to take time off.'
$dance_coach = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- Beauty and smooth movements is what I have devoted my life to, <<$master_name>>. The gallop of a well-trained horse is like a wonderful dance. And I can teach your slave both of them. You know the price.'
$gladiatrix_coach = '  [MASTER GERALD]<br>- It is not by hearsay that I know about battle, <<$master_name>>. I often had to fight to the death and this is what I will teach your slave. I can’t promise gladiatorial subtleties and theatricality, but she will be able to fight properly.'
$pet_coach = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- It is not so easy to bring up a good pet, but you can rely on me in this matter, <<$master_name>>. What do you prefer, affectionate cats or trained bitches?'
$cow_coach = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- I am the only one in the Eternal Rome that has ever successfully smuggled cows through the Fog. Cows are my passion, <<$master_name>>. I couldn’t live without them. For such a task, your slave will be under the best possible supervision.'
$expression_coach = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- Correct, competent and confident speech-craft is needed for any publicly demonstrated slave. I will make it so that you do not need to be ashamed to appear with your slave in public!'
! JO9 MOD START J9M0016 | 2026-10-01_robertus_rufus_art_tutor | changed block; context may be included
$art_coach = '  [ROBERTUS RUFUS]<br>- Oh, my friend, the <<$slave_noun4[slave["age"]]>> herself is like a beautiful canvas! I’ll teach your slave to paint without hesitation. We’ll work on her talent, ja!'

! Art tutor: separate identity; original lesson grades and effects retained.
! JO9 MOD START RNL132 | 2026-10-17_zz_rank_display_labels
! RNL: 표시 등급 문자만 변경; 같은 대입문의 연결 줄은 원문을 유지한다.
$robertus_rufus_diligence[0] = '  [ROBERTUS RUFUS]<br>- Schrecklich! I have never met a <<$slave_noun4[slave["age"]]>> less concentrated. Is it possible to comprehend the mystery of painting while counting crows on the lesson? Nein!!' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#cd0000"><b>F</b></font>'
$robertus_rufus_diligence[1] = '  [ROBERTUS RUFUS]<br>- Es bringt nichts. She does not feel the painting at all. She executes my orders, but where is the soul? Where? Painting requires a soul, mein Herr!' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#EA0090"><b>D</b></font>'
$robertus_rufus_diligence[2] = '  [ROBERTUS RUFUS]<br>- Schwach! I tried to make her understand the beauty of painting but only with minimal effect. She has no real desire for painting, she is missing the feuer.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#6B0084"><b>C</b></font>'
$robertus_rufus_diligence[3] = '  [ROBERTUS RUFUS]<br>- Nicht schlecht… the lesson was successful. I’ve seen more able pupils, but your slave still shows enough diligence to move forward.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#0000D8"><b>B</b></font>'
$robertus_rufus_diligence[4] = '  [ROBERTUS RUFUS]<br>- Gut, gut! She’s an attentive and sensitive slave. It is clear that she wants to learn. Desire is most important! Today we made good progress, ja!' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>A</b></font>'
$robertus_rufus_diligence[5] = '  [ROBERTUS RUFUS]<br>- Fantastisch! Great diligence. Your slave listens to me as carefully as I study the paintings of the greatest painters. I am confident that her training will be very, very successful!' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>S</b></font>'
! JO9 MOD END RNL132
! JO9 MOD END J9M0016
$magic_coach = '  [MASTER S]<br>- Slaves are not allowed to learn the highest arts of spark magic, <<$master_name>>. It’s too dangerous in battle. But I will teach her all about item enchanting and potion creation. However, do not expect miracles. It all depends on her talent.'
$music_coach = '  [MASTER VON WALTZ]<br>- Oh, my friend, the <<$slave_noun1[slave["age"]]>> herself is like a beautiful musical instrument! I’ll teach your slave to play without hesitation. A complete set of flute, violin, and of course piano!'

$S_diligence[0] = '  [MASTER S]<br>- Disgusting! In my entire career I have only had one student as worthless as your slave. He was a boy who was struck by lightning.' + _
' <font color="#cd0000"><b>Minus fifty points!</b></font>'
$S_diligence[1] = '  [MASTER S]<br>- Zero effort. Why sit in the classroom if she only waits for class to end? I would waste less time trying to teach a turnip!' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#EA0090"><b>Minus twenty points!</b></font>'
$S_diligence[2] = '  [MASTER S]<br>- Hmm… bad, bad. I managed to make her learn a few things, but she clearly was not inclined to help me. Who would be distracted while being taught the art of crafting potions?!' + _
' <font color="#6B0084"><b>Minus ten points!</b></font>'
$S_diligence[3] = '  [MASTER S]<br>- Acceptable result. I must pay tribute, you educated your slave properly. However, to make any real progress, she needs full concentration and desire to learn. She still has room to grow in this regard.' + _
' <font color="#0000D8"><b>Plus ten points</b></font>, so be it.'
$S_diligence[4] = '  [MASTER S]<br>- Good. I rarely work with students who pay proper attention to the lessons. I am glad that your slave belongs to this rare group, <<$master_name>>.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>Plus twenty points</b></font>, deservedly.'
$S_diligence[5] = '  [MASTER S]<br>- I’m surprised, <<$master_name>>. I did not expect a slave to be of such exceptional diligence. She really tries her best and puts her soul into it.' + _
' <font color="#009900"><b>Plus fifty points!</b></font>'

