! JO9 MOD START RNL130 | 2026-10-17_zz_rank_display_labels
! RNL: 표시 등급 문자만 변경; 같은 대입문의 연결 줄은 원문을 유지한다.
$avgia_diligence[0] = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- Terrible! <<$master_name>>, tell me the truth, why did you give me a slave that shows no signs of obedience? She will learn nothing!' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#cd0000"><b>F</b></font>'
$avgia_diligence[1] = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- Not a very good lesson, <<$master_name>>. Your slave does not pay enough attention to what I say and show.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#EA0090"><b>D</b></font>'
$avgia_diligence[2] = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- We made some progress, of course, but I would like her to be more motivated, <<$master_name>>. As long as your slave believes that the training is for you, not for her own benefit, we will not see full commitment in the lessons.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#6B0084"><b>C</b></font>'
$avgia_diligence[3] = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- We worked quite efficiently. I think you will immediately notice the results, <<$master_name>>.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#0000D8"><b>B</b></font>'
$avgia_diligence[4] = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- We had a great exercise with your slave, <<$master_name>>. You will immediately notice the results.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>A</b></font>'
$avgia_diligence[5] = '  [MISTRESS AUGEAS]<br>- Brilliant! Such a responsive, attentive and diligent <<$slave_noun4[slave["age"]]>>. Well, just lovely. I would love to work only with girls like her. I even thought about discounting her training cost, <<$master_name>>.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>S</b></font>'
! JO9 MOD END RNL130

! JO9 MOD START RNL129 | 2026-10-17_zz_rank_display_labels
! RNL: 표시 등급 문자만 변경; 같은 대입문의 연결 줄은 원문을 유지한다.
$geralt_diligence[0] = '  [MASTER GERALD]<br>- Your girl does not wish to learn. She just wants to sit on her ass and feel sorry for herself. Not that I gave her the opportunity, but training will go better if a slave is motivated.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#cd0000"><b>F</b></font>'
$geralt_diligence[1] = '  [MASTER GERALD]<br>- I saw a lot of lazy weaklings, but your slave is in the forefront of them, <<$master_name>>. She only learns with great difficulty. However, I still taught her a few things.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#EA0090"><b>D</b></font>'
$geralt_diligence[2] = '  [MASTER GERALD]<br>- If you ask my advice, I would recommend working on the slave’s motivation. Of course, she does everything she is ordered to but without any spark. It will take her a long time to learn anything.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#6B0084"><b>C</b></font>'
$geralt_diligence[3] = '  [MASTER GERALD]<br>- Your girl is well educated, <<$master_name>>. This is sufficient for productive lessons. With such diligence, I will teach her quickly, and she will be able to learn all the necessary skills.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#0000D8"><b>B</b></font>'
$geralt_diligence[4] = '  [MASTER GERALD]<br>- Great motivation for training, <<$master_name>>. Your girl is really aware about the importance of our lessons, and it is pleasant to work with her. If you want her trained again simply call me again. Just give her some time to rest.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>A</b></font>'
$geralt_diligence[5] = '  [MASTER GERALD]<br>- Your girl has a great spirit, <<$master_name>>. She strives to learn everything I am willing to teach her. Everyone would desire to have a slave like her!' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>S</b></font>'
! JO9 MOD END RNL129

! JO9 MOD START RNL128 | 2026-10-17_zz_rank_display_labels
! RNL: 표시 등급 문자만 변경; 같은 대입문의 연결 줄은 원문을 유지한다.
$marivanna_diligence[0] = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- Your slave doesn’t have any motivation, <<$master_name>>. All my explanations are useless because of this attitude.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#cd0000"><b>F, very poor</b></font>'
$marivanna_diligence[1] = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- Your slave is constantly distracted and does not want to listen to me. With such diligence, it is better to do something more simple.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#EA0090"><b>D, unsatisfactory</b></font>'
$marivanna_diligence[2] = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- Of course I used to have students even worse than your slave, <<$master_name>>, but do not expect great progress.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#6B0084"><b>C, satisfactory</b></font>'
$marivanna_diligence[3] = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- You could increase her motivation, but overall, I’m satisfied with the results, <<$master_name>>. I think that we made some progress today.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#0000D8"><b>B, good</b></font>'
$marivanna_diligence[4] = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- She really is motivated to learn, <<$master_name>>. Your slave really wants to learn everything I teach her, you’ll notice the progress we made.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>A, excellent</b></font>'
$marivanna_diligence[5] = '  [MISTRESS MARIVANNA]<br>- Your slave really is no ordinary pupil, <<$master_name>>. I have rarely seen someone with more motivation to learn.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>S, perfect</b></font>'
! JO9 MOD END RNL128

! JO9 MOD START RNL127 | 2026-10-17_zz_rank_display_labels
! RNL: 표시 등급 문자만 변경; 같은 대입문의 연결 줄은 원문을 유지한다.
$jeeves_diligence[0] = '  [MASTER JEEVES]<br>- In my opinion, <<$master_name>>, your slave is not ready. She doesn’t want to learn and thus will not learn anything. She needs proper training and must be more submissive.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#cd0000"><b>F</b></font>'
$jeeves_diligence[1] = '  [MASTER JEEVES]<br>- The diligence of your slave is unsatisfactory, she works under compulsion. Of course, we made some progress, but for decent results you need to work on her motivation.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#EA0090"><b>D</b></font>'
$jeeves_diligence[2] = '  [MASTER JEEVES]<br>- Your slave learns reluctantly, but at least she is aware of the importance of success for herself. I can work with it and I will give you results. But if you want to make more rapid progress - work on her motivation.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#6B0084"><b>C</b></font>'
$jeeves_diligence[3] = '  [MASTER JEEVES]<br>- Good spirit for the lesson is half of the work. And that half you already did for me. Thank you, <<$master_name>>. Your slave made some good progress.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#0000D8"><b>B</b></font>'
$jeeves_diligence[4] = '  [MASTER JEEVES]<br>- Great diligence leads to excellent results. I can say that it is pleasant to work with your slave, <<$master_name>>. It would be nice to have more pupils like her.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>A</b></font>'
$jeeves_diligence[5] = '  [MASTER JEEVES]<br>- How did you increase her motivation so much, <<$master_name>>? I did not have to explain a single thing twice. She learned everything on-the-fly, I swear.' + _
' Her grade for the lesson: <font color="#009900"><b>S</b></font>'
! JO9 MOD END RNL127
!not used
$auction_intro[1] = '   [Госпожа Анжелика]
   - Ну какой может быть аукцион, <<$master_name>>?! Старый Охотник ещё даже не брался за аукционный зал... Тут в гильдии кроме меня и доски объявлений вообще ничего нету. Тоска смертная.'
$auction_intro[2] = '   [Госпожа Анжелика]
   - Ладно, ладно. Я знаю что тебе негде продавать рабынь, так что я могу брать у тебя готовый материал на перепродажу по твёрдой рыночной цене. Но только в плане эксперимента. Теперь слушай внимательно условия.'
$auction_intro[3] = '   [Госпожа Анжелика]
   - Беру клеймлёную рабыню с рейтингом D и выше, по соответствующей цене. Специальные пожелания: экспертная <font color="#008080"><b>выносливость</b></font>, профессиональная <font color="#0000CD"><b>кулинария</b></font> и компетентная <font color="#4B0082"><b>уборка</b></font>. За девственниц дополнительная плата.'
!-------------------!
!REALTOR GLORIA
$realtor_first_meet[1] = '  [OFFICE LADY]<br>- Good day, sir. My name is Gloria. I am an account manager here. I’d be happy to assist you.'
$realtor_first_meet[2] = '  [<<$master_name>>]<br>- Hi, Gloria. My name is <<$master_name>>. I am a member of the Slavers Guild and want to lease a suitable apartment for work. I think you might have what I’m looking for.'
$realtor_first_meet[3] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- I am sure we can help you, <<$master_name>>. Members of the Slavers Guild are automatically considered VIP clients. I will be your personal real estate consultant.'
$realtor_first_meet[4] = '  [<<$master_name>>]<br>- Alright. I don’t have any experience with real estate in the Eternal Rome. So tell me what’s what.'
$realtor_first_meet[5] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Of course, sir. If you have enough sparks - there is nothing easier than renting a property for such a respected man. Our company will make the process as simple and efficient as possible. First, you need to choose which district you want to live in.'
!$realtor_first_meet[6] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- If you have a bad relationship with one of the Great Houses, they might not give you permission to settle in. Living in the White Town is a privilege offered only to those of high repute. We will do the proper checks before offering you any options. Depending on the district, the rental price and prestige vary greatly.'
$realtor_first_meet[6] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- If you have a bad relationship with one of the Great Houses, they might not give you permission to settle in. Living in the White Town is a privilege offered only to patricians. We will do the proper checks before offering you any options. Depending on the district, the rental price and prestige vary greatly.'
$realtor_first_meet[7] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Another important factor is the size of the premises. The anthill of the Serpentine Quarter offers little space while the Necropolis and White Town homes have extended layouts, offering more space for furniture and equipment.'
$realtor_first_meet[8] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- We select all the homes so that they have a basic set of amenities: a large furnished room, a separate bedroom, a bathroom with hot water and a kitchen. Some districts include more amenities. If you need additional space, it can be rented for a fee.'
$realtor_first_meet[9] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Knowing a slaver’s needs, we will only offer you homes where you have or can easily rent an extra room for your slave, a reliable prison and an alchemical laboratory. The cost differs from district to district.'
$realtor_first_meet[10] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- All of our homes are already decorated and ready to live in. But if you want to change the interior, for a small fee, we will redecorate everything to your liking. This process will only take a single day.'
$realtor_first_meet[11] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- We also have rental options for specialized rooms that are reasonably priced. If you need to store extra equipment or stalls for pets - please inquire.'
$realtor_first_meet[12] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- As far as payment goes, we take an advance payment for ten days rent and additional fees for furnishing, amortization and repairs. These bills are collected once per decade. You may end the contract at any time.'
$realtor_first_meet[13] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- My company also provides a special offer to our VIP clients. If you rent a new apartment, your account manager, me, will satisfy all your wishes for one hour.'
$realtor_first_meet[14] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- So, <<$master_name>>, just tell me the district you want to live in and I will personally guide you through the apartment for free.'

$realtor_no_sex[1] = ' [GLORIA]
- Sign here and here. Excellent. And here are the keys. Congratulations on your profitable purchase, <<$master_name>>! As a compliment from our firm, allow me to offer you my services as your personal slave for the next hour.'
$realtor_no_sex[2] = ' [<<$master_name>>]
- Okay. The services of a personal slave will come in handy: clean up here nicely, and cook me something to eat. Otherwise, what kind of housewarming would it be without a feast?'
$realtor_no_sex[3] = ' Gloria obviously expected me to use her in another way, but frankly, I’m not in the mood for sex right now.'
$realtor_no_sex[4] = ' One way or another, the girl coped with the task quite well. She quickly and skillfully tidied up the premises and prepared a decent dinner. Then I took the keys to the new house, said goodbye to Gloria and waited for the movers to bring my things.'
$realtor_bonus_sex[1] = ' [GLORIA]
- Sign here and here. Wonderful. And here are the keys. Congratulations on a profitable purchase, <<$master_name>>! As a compliment from our company, allow me to offer you my services as your personal slave for the next hour.'
$realtor_bonus_sex[2] = ' [<<$master_name>>]
- A personal slave? Hmm, not bad. I just wanted to test the durability of the local bed... '
$realtor_bonus_sex[3] = ' Gloria smiled seductively and gently took off my clothes, kissing each new part of my body that remained naked. When she got into my panties, I was already wet... Her skillful tongue came in very handy...'
$realtor_bonus_sex[4] = ' [<<$master_name>>]
- Clever girl... Good girl... But you are capable of more! Isn’t that so?! You want me to feel good, don’t you, Gloria?'
$realtor_bonus_sex[5] = ' The hint was understood correctly, and Gloria set to work with redoubled energy. Her hands, body, lips wandered over me so pleasantly that I began to flow. The girl moaned no quieter than me, and I realized that she had been trained well - she was pretending almost sincerely.'
$realtor_bonus_sex[6] = ' Gloria showed me everything she could do. And when I came and fell back on the bed, exhausted, she kissed me goodbye, left the keys on the nightstand, and left.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[1] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The infamous quarter of the Outcasts is under the jurisdiction of the Camira Great House. The residential buildings are not centralized and the quality of the housing in general is… ahem… pretty basic. At least the crime rates are lower than in the slums.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[2] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Nevertheless, there are several reasons to rent a place here. First, and most importantly, it’s hard to find something more affordable. Rent is cheap and affordable. Secondly, in contrast to the Serpentine quarter, homes are spacious. Thirdly, as a benefit for residents, small-scale livestock can be kept for free at the public animal farm in this district.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[3] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The policy of our company does not provide pre-furnished rooms in the Outcast Quarter, so interior design can be a little… umm… basic. But if necessary, we can change everything to your liking and make the rooms very cozy.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[4] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Here you can see a spacious hall decorated in the spirit of animal-minimalism. The furniture is assembled from readily available materials but is highly durable, as it was built for beastmen service.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[5] = '  You carefully inspect the room. In your opinion, it is just a pigsty. Only a very undemanding person could live here.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[6] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s proceed to the bedroom. The bedroom has a set of high-quality furniture. A great budget option. The bed is very sturdy, from solid canoyan oak.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[7] = '  Not as bad as expected from this dump - you were expecting the worst. If you change the bedsheets, sleeping here might be pretty nice. Although the interior is a bit depressing.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[8] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Now the bathroom. Despite needing some plumbing every now and again, the pipes are still in order. Occasionally though rusty water might come out of the faucet. And some caimans are living in the sewerage below the toilet, but they never leave that place so don’t worry.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[9] = '  This place stinks. Am I really supposed to wash here? And caimans in the toilet… is she serious or just kidding? They might crawl up my pussy.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[10] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And now: The kitchen. As you can see, the interior is very spacious, there is everything you need for cooking. The stasis chamber for food is fully functional. It is a decent option for any home.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[11] = '  The kitchen here is really decent. The furniture is old and cracked in places though, but the room is really spacious. Plus, it has something vaguely familiar… I feel like I have seen this kitchen somewhere. Hmmm…'
$realtor_demo_kamira[12] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- For an additional fee you can rent additional space in the same building. Everything you might need can be rented at quite acceptable conditions: there are options for a torture room, an alchemy lab and a cozy boudoir.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[13] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Take a look. A great room for a humble slave. Only a minimum set of furniture so that she will not be distracted, but everything needed is here. And the amount of space complements the existing decor.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[14] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- As a representative of the Slavers Guild, you probably will be interested in the local dungeon. A very safe place for torture or imprisonment. The walls are a bit cracked and the ceiling often leaks, but given the purpose of this room…'
$realtor_demo_kamira[15] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- If you are proficient in the art of enchantment and magic, you can rent a local alchemy lab. The equipment here is pretty old but is quite functional. You can mix potions and enchant without any problem.'
$realtor_demo_kamira[16] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The cost of renting the main premises, excluding utilities, is only <<estate_cost_main["kamira_house"]>> sparks for ten days. If you wish, you can move in today, just pay the rent for the current decade in advance plus <<estate_cost_main["kamira_house"]/10>> sparks as agency commission.'

$realtor_demo_white[1] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- White Town is under the direct jurisdiction of the Vatican and an exemplary peace and order reigns. The crime rate is virtually nil. Housing stock is entirely elite and in excellent condition. You cannot find any better apartments than these.'
$realtor_demo_white[2] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Of course, the price of living here is considerable, but still, everything is in close proximity and you can be sure that you have decent neighbors. With the enhanced design of the homes, you can keep much more furniture and equipment than usual.'
$realtor_demo_white[3] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- All the rooms are recently renovated and tastefully decorated by our best designers. The style is strict, elite. Of course, if you want something added or changed, we are happy to take the job.'
$realtor_demo_white[4] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s start with the examination of the living room. The walls are decorated with panels of sandalwood, parquet from rosewood blocks. The furniture is upholstered in natural leather. Very stylish and comfortable.'
$realtor_demo_white[5] = '  You carefully inspect the room. Yes, you really want to live here. Of course, you could arrange it even more chic, but then it would feel like the palace.'
$realtor_demo_white[6] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s proceed to the bedroom. The luxurious king sized bed not only looks elegant but also possesses great durability. It can easily withstand any of your ventures and experiments.'
$realtor_demo_white[7] = '  The bed is really nice. And the rest of the decor is impressive. You can sleep here perfectly and deal with slaves without any problems.'
$realtor_demo_white[8] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And this is the bathroom. Tiled in natural stone. Excellent plumbing, large mirrors. There is a wide window for observing from the living room - your slave will always be visible.'
$realtor_demo_white[9] = '  Window in the wall? They are entertainers here, huh. However, this will come in handy with my job. And the plumbing is just great.'
$realtor_demo_white[10] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And the kitchen. This spacious room is furnished with the latest appliances. Here, everything you need to cook the best dishes is present. The stasis chamber for different products has increased capacity.'
$realtor_demo_white[11] = '  I carefully look around. The kitchen looks awesome. And more importantly - surprisingly spacious. Good-good.'
$realtor_demo_white[12] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Everything that you might need is included or can be rented at quite acceptable conditions. A torture room and a luxurious boudoir are included here. For an additional fee, we offer to rent space for an alchemical laboratory in the same building.'
$realtor_demo_white[13] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Take a look. A great room for any slave. This king-sized bed with a canopy and a red blanket - is really a bed of love. The door can be securely locked from the outside.'
$realtor_demo_white[14] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- As a representative of the Slavers Guild, you probably will be interested in the local dungeon. Even the largest of torture devices can fit in this room. Inside the cells, there are lattices and hooks with brackets to securely lock a prisoner in place. A great workplace.'
$realtor_demo_white[15] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- If you are proficient in the art of enchantment and magic, you can rent a local alchemy lab. A very cozy and nice room with plenty of bookcases and reinforced walls in case of an explosion or a fire.'
$realtor_demo_white[16] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The cost of renting the main premises, excluding utilities, is <<estate_cost_main["white_house"]>> sparks for ten days. If you wish, you can move in today, just pay the rent for the current decade in advance plus <<estate_cost_main["white_house"]/10>> sparks as agency commission.'

$realtor_demo_korvus[1] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- This district is called the Necropolis because it is under the jurisdiction of the Corvus Great House. Some feel like this area is dark and intimidating but in my opinion, it is very majestic. And there is a special area for the living.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[2] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Rental price is quite significant, but it is understandable since the crime rate in this quarter is almost lower than in White Town and the size of the apartments is just the same. Rumors of wild ghouls attacking and outbreaks of zombie virus - it’s just fairy tales.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[3] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- This is a local apartment decorated in necro-gothic style, fully ready for occupancy. Let me once again emphasize the extra-spacious rooms and reliability of designs. But see for yourself.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[4] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s start with the examination of the living room. All of the rooms have high ceilings, including the living room. The interior is designed in red and black. The whole decoration emits an aura of luxury, elegance and high quality, don’t you think?'
$realtor_demo_korvus[5] = '  You carefully inspect the room. It feels somewhat gloomy, of course, but damn it is beautiful. Really beautiful. So this is what they call “necro-gothic” style?'
$realtor_demo_korvus[6] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s proceed to the bedroom. A low but large bed with upholstered headboard is perfect for any sexual practices. Even though it was picked by beings who sleep in coffins - the bed is still perfect.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[7] = '  The bed is really nice. And the rest of the decor is impressive. You can sleep here perfectly and deal with slaves without any problems.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[8] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And this is the bathroom. The floor is made of dark polished marble. You can be sure that no leaked liquid will drip from the ceiling of your neighbor.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[9] = '  You examine the bathroom with interest. Somewhat old-fashioned but at the same time very stylish. I like that.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[10] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And the kitchen. A very cozy and old-fashioned kitchen, but do not be fooled by the archaic appearance - everything you need to practice cooking is present. It is worth noting that the stasis chamber has increased capacity.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[11] = '  You look around carefully. The kitchen is awesome. And most importantly - surprisingly spacious. Good-good.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[12] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Everything that you might need is included or can be rented at quite acceptable conditions. A torture room and a luxurious boudoir are included here. For an additional fee, we offer to rent space for an alchemical laboratory in the same building.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[13] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Take a look. You could train a slave worthy of the pope’s attention without any problem in here. Any slave should be comfortable with the great decoration and appreciate your concern for her.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[14] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- As a representative of the Slavers Guild, you probably will be interested in the local dungeon. A gloomy room with stone walls and securely lockable cell. No one will hear the screams of your victims.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[15] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- If you are proficient in the art of enchantment and magic, you can rent a local alchemy lab. Liches are experts in sorcery and this laboratory was furnished by a lich - ancient and powerful.'
$realtor_demo_korvus[16] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The cost of renting the main premises, excluding utilities, is <<estate_cost_main["korvus_house"]>> sparks for ten days. If you wish, you can move in today, just pay the rent for the current decade in advance plus <<estate_cost_main["korvus_house"]/10>> sparks as agency commission.'

$realtor_demo_taurus[1] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- This district is under the jurisdiction of the Taurus Great House. It is inhabited by the “faithful” - people honoring the Savior, and they receive special support from Vatican. There are fewer people here than in the Serpentine quarter so order is maintained at high levels.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[2] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The price is moderate. Local apartments are the best choice for someone who knows how to save their sparks and wants to live in a decent, peaceful place.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[3] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Rooms for rent are furnished in a neo-medieval style, which is quite popular among members of the Taurus House. However, if you wish, you can change the design of the interior.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[4] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s start with the examination of the living room. This is a knight’s hall with arched vaults and good sturdy furniture. The walls are decorated with tapestries. Lighting is provided by candles.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[5] = '  You carefully inspect the room. It does not feel luxurious enough, but the room is very respectable nonetheless. It has some kind of Nordic severity.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[6] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s proceed to the bedroom. This spacious bed can be cut off completely from the outside world by heavy velvet curtains, if you wish.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[7] = '  The bed is really nice. And the rest of the decor is impressive. You can sleep here perfectly and deal with slaves without any problems.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[8] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And here is the bathroom. Nothing fancy, but all the plumbing is in place and in perfect working order.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[9] = '  You examine the bathroom with interest. Perhaps it will work for the time being.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[10] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And the kitchen. A very solid kitchen in medieval style. Richly trimmed with solid oak. Of course, there is a stasis chamber so your products will never be spoiled.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[11] = '  You carefully examine the room. The kitchen is quite cluttered and smells of smoke, but it has a certain brutal charm.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[12] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Everything that you might need is included or can be rented at quite acceptable conditions. A torture room is included here. For an additional fee, we offer to rent space for a luxurious boudoir and an alchemical laboratory in the same building.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[13] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Here, take a look at this room that can be rented for your slave. A wonderful and very comfortable boudoir, decorated with pieces of oriental motifs.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[14] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- As a representative of the Slavers Guild, you probably will be interested in the local dungeon. The walls are thick and the low oppressive ceiling will make anyone feel uncomfortable. The very room will already instill horror in your prisoners.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[15] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- If you are proficient in the art of enchantment and magic, you can rent a local alchemy lab. Despite the apparent mess, everything you need for alchemy and enchanting is present.'
$realtor_demo_taurus[16] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The cost of renting the main premises, excluding utilities, is <<estate_cost_main["taurus_house"]>> sparks for ten days. If you wish, you can move in today, just pay the rent for the current decade in advance plus <<estate_cost_main["taurus_house"]/10>> sparks as agency commission.'

$realtor_demo_serpis[1] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The residential Zone of the Serpentine quarter is called the “anthill” because of the incredibly high population density and development. The Serpis Great House, under whose jurisdiction this district is, has a lot of subjects. Unfortunately, due to the crowding, a lot of crimes are committed.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[2] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- If you are low on money and do not want to spend extra sparks, the anthill will be a good choice. Yes, the apartments here are small but they are very cheap. And the situation for people is still less dangerous than in the quarter of the Outcasts. Plus, a Technosphere and an Illusory Sea are nearby.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[3] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The apartment decoration is minimalist, for maximum space saving, which is sorely needed. However, if you prefer to have more decorations, we could find a solution.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[4] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s start with the examination of the living room. Not too big, fitted rather for work than for reception. The furniture is reliable, made out of steel. There are no windows, but the ventilation has a special, technically advanced system.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[5] = '  You carefully inspect the room. Yeah, it is possible to get claustrophobic. What else can you do to save money? Rent a house from beastmen? No way.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[6] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Let’s proceed to the bedroom. Even though this apartment is very small, the bedroom is very comfortable. The bed is spacious, suitable for your work.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[7] = '  You look around. It’s the only decent place of this apartment. Somewhat cozy even.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[8] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And here is the bathroom. Small, but as you can see, it is very modernly furnished.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[9] = '  You examine the bathroom with interest. A pretty small one, but it has really decent plumbing.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[10] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- And the kitchen. This kitchen is combined with the dining room. As long as no more than two people dine in this room it might even feel rather spacious.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[11] = '  You carefully examine the room. The kitchen is quite normal. The only bad thing is that the stasis chamber is too small.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[12] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- For an additional fee, we offer to rent additional space in the same building. Everything you might need can be rented at quite acceptable conditions: there are options for a torture room, an alchemy lab and a modest boudoir.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[13] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- Here, take a look at this room. Your slave will feel like she has earned her own room while not making her too proud or lazy.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[14] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- As a representative of the Slavers Guild, you probably will be interested in the local dungeon. The walls are covered with refractory reinforced plastic. There is a metal bed and a toilet of the “slop bucket” type.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[15] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- If you are proficient in the art of enchantment and magic, you can rent a local alchemy lab. This is a modest but perfectly functional alchemy lab, except that it has not enough space for books.'
$realtor_demo_serpis[16] = '  [GLORIA]<br>- The cost of renting the main premises, excluding utilities, is <<estate_cost_main["serpis_house"]>> sparks for ten days. If you wish, you can move in today, just pay the rent for the current decade in advance plus <<estate_cost_main["serpis_house"]/10>> sparks as agency commission.'
