$realtor_demo_otchuzhdenie[1] = '  [GLORIA]
- The Exclusion Zone - a place where I personally wouldn’t dare go out for a walk alone... The quality of housing is mostly... ahem... basic. In addition, the crime rate is only slightly better than in the slums.'
$realtor_demo_otchuzhdenie[2] = '  [GLORIA]
- Nevertheless, there are several reasons to rent accommodation here. Firstly, and most importantly, it’s difficult to find anything more affordable. The rent will be very inexpensive. Secondly, unlike the Snake Quarter, the houses here are quite spacious.'
$realtor_demo_otchuzhdenie[3] = '  [GLORIA]
- Our firm’s policy does not include pre-furnishing rooms in the Exclusion Zone, so the interior design may be somewhat... mmm... secondary. But if necessary, we can change everything here to your taste and make the rooms very cozy.'
