!МИСТРА
$mystra_spd[0] = 'Although Mystra offers many products, you are really only interested in four of them: Elysian Datura - relaxes; Kamrian Resin - refreshes; Faeries’ Pollen - a powerful stimulant; and the Essence of Oblivion - dulls pain and fear. All of them can be used in alchemy.'
$mystra_spd[1] = 'Elysian datura is a widespread smoking mixture with moderately strong but quite expressed psychoactive effect. Relaxes, soothes and gives a special feeling of floating. May have negative effect on people’s emotions if consumed too often.'
$mystra_spd[2] = 'Kamrian resin is used in the making of a thick black beverage with a slight energizing effect. They say that it is impossible to make it properly without magic - and it tastes bitter. However, many drink kamra every morning to wake up. And they no longer can wake up without it…'
$mystra_spd[3] = 'Pollen from the wings of fairies is rubbed into gums or directly sniffed, sharply rising its effect. But its effect rapidly depletes the body’s resources and is extremely dangerous to health in the long term.'
$mystra_spd[4] = 'Essence of oblivion is an extremely insidious substance that destroyed a lot of unhappy and weak-willed souls. After entering a person’s blood, it takes away all the problems and all the pain, bringing pure pleasure and taking you into the world of leisurely, carefree dreams. Impossible to refuse.'

$elixir_help[1] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- I have many substances for sale that can affect the body and soul, but they are dangerous and even treacherous. They are addictive, destroy you from inside. Some almost imperceptibly, others hit you like a truck.'
$elixir_help[2] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- Using the power of Sparks of the Flame of Creation, you can convert them into something much more powerful and at the same time safer. For example, if you use the usual stimulant, it draws strength from the reserves of your body. But the elixir works differently.'
$elixir_help[3] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- If you want to create potions for yourself, then you will need a specially equipped laboratory and someone who understands how to brew them. You will also want to buy a multitude of ingredients I have for sale.'
$elixir_help[4] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- You must always start with a basis… and there are a lot of options to choose from. Some elixirs can be brewed with spring water. Most of them can be brewed with an alcohol basis, but the strongest are made with the mucus of a Fog fiend.'
$elixir_help[5] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- Then the alchemist must mix the potion’s ingredients in the right proportions and awaken them with Sparks. If the alchemist has insufficient experience or you messed something up with the recipe you will get a worthless slipslop. Well, or a herbal bitter.'
$elixir_help[6] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- But if you make everything right, you can get a truly magical composition. Just do not ask me to do these for you, I do not even have a laboratory. I just sell the ingredients.'

$bahus_help[1] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- Take fairies’ pollen, kamrian resin and some essence of oblivion, then boil them in spring water. You’ll get the simplest of all elixirs, which is called Bacchus’ Nectar or Bacchus’ Wine.'
$bahus_help[2] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- This nectar has a divine taste and gives the effect of drunkenness similar to alcohol, strong but at the same time very soft. It also awakens your fleshly desire.'

$tonic_help[1] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- Take fairies’ pollen, kamrian resin and some essence of oblivion, then distill them using strong alcohol. You’ll get a very useful tonic elixir that instantly recovers your strength.'
$tonic_help[2] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- This tonic is really wonderful, but you need to be careful with it. Abuse can lead to tragic consequences.'

$cure_help[1] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- To get the miracle balm, take fairies’ pollen, kamrian resin and some essence of oblivion, then mix them using Fog fiend’s mucus.'
$cure_help[2] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- The healing effect will be instantaneous on fresh wounds and because of that many people use the balm right in combat. But it may also heal old wounds.'

$afro_help[1] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- If you mix kamrian resin, fairies’ pollen and elysian datura in just the right proportion, you will receive an aphrodisiac that stimulates your feelings and raises your arousal.'
$afro_help[2] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- The aphrodisiac can be stronger or weaker depending on the alchemist’s skill and the basis that you will use. But bear in mind that you can’t brew it on the basis of water.'

$letha_help[1] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- If you properly mix kamrian resin, elysian datura and some essence of oblivion, you can get a dangerous elixir called ’Water of Lethe’. Any basis is fine for brewing this elixir, even spring water is fine.'
$letha_help[2] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- Lethe is a river in the realm of the dead. Drinking from Lethe will make you forget all the troubles and passions of your worldly life. Remember that the imbiber will forget everything - be it good or bad.'

$morpot_help[1] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- To brew a love potion or philtre, take a Fog fiend’s mucus as the basis and mix some essence of oblivion with elysian datura and fairies’ pollen.'
$morpot_help[2] = '  [MYSTRA]<br>- The imbiber of this potion will experience an unperceived attraction and affection for the first person they will see. The effect is not too strong but very persistent.'

!SOULNET
$infodata_aura[1] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Request is being processed… Please wait…'
$infodata_aura[2] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Aura. A visual manifestation of the psychofield that is created by the immortal soul of any sentient being. Particularly pronounced in the territory of the Eternal Rome and can be analyzed with the help of spark magic of basic order.'
$infodata_aura[3] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Stable emotions and features of consciousness can be seen in the aura and be analyzed based on form, color and size. Analyzing an aura allows for the internal state of a subject to be known.'
$infodata_aura[4] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- The overall brightness and density of the aura corresponds to the subject’s personal power. The brightness of the aura is affected by parameters such as intellectual development, temperament, openness, physical strength, health and mental fortitude.'
$infodata_aura[5] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- A stronger aura is able to suppress beings with a weaker aura at close range, causing the weaker subject to act as a subordinate. This effect is not absolute though.'
$infodata_aura[6] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- To intentionally increase the power of an aura, special psychomagic augmented objects or corresponding rites are often used.'
$infodata_aura[7] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Would you like to receive information about the aura’s classification of stable visual patterns?'

$infodata_aura_patterns[1] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- The aura’s motion, its change in shape or throbbing is an indicator of the emotional display of the subject. Sharp fluctuations in the aura usually are an indicator of anger or sexual desire. With proper experience, they are easy to distinguish.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[2] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Red indicates a conscious fear, directed at an object or a subject present in the immediate vicinity of the aura’s source. Appears in the form of flashes, which occur more frequently and persist longer at higher levels of fear.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[3] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- A dark color indicates negative subconscious emotions. Usually observed in the depth of the aura, when amplified, they spread in the form of distinctive “snakes” or “tentacles”.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[4] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- The dominance of dark substructures in the aura suggests a strong sense of hopelessness and despair. This is able to lead to a gradual degradation of the individual: over time, will and motivational spheres will destruct and individuality will be lost.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[5] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Violet, purple or amethyst color corresponds to the state of intellectual development. Its presence indicates that the source of the aura has a strong opinion on a nearby present subject.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[6] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Well-formed globules of amethyst color in the aura are an indicator that the subject has a clear understanding of their position and has fully developed an attitude fitting for the situation.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[7] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Yellow or gold substructures formed like elongated strings or rods indicate high levels of instinctive discipline. This usually suggests that a nearby present human is subconsciously perceived as a leader.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[8] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- A blue glow around the edges of the aura indicates familiarity with the current situation and that the current situation is perceived as quite ordinary and normal. Indicates a low expectation of change.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[9] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- Sharp pink iridescence in the outer part of the aura suggests that a nearby object or entity is perceived by the subject as a source of wealth, fit for selfish use and manipulation.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[10] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- A green structure in the form of stars is formed in the presence of a subject or object that is an important factor in the moral choices of the individual.'
$infodata_aura_patterns[11] = '  [SOULNET TERMINAL]<br>- There are also other less stable structures that are poorly amenable for classification and analysis because of their ambiguity or short time in existence.'
!Library_city
!SPECIAL TASKS
$aramus_fail[1] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- Yes. I still need a champion gladiatrix. Deliver a proper girl and I’ll give you the “Bull Ring”. A great thing, I assure you!'
$wujen_fail[1] = '  [Vujin the Wise]<br>- How are things with the racing champion? I got the amulet already, it is just waiting for its time.'
$garsid_fail[1] = '  [GARSID]<br>- Remember, ssslaver: I need a complete whore. Ssso sshe needsss to know everythssing about sssexss. Everythssing… perfectly, perfectly!'
$magister_vailos_fail[1] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- How is the fiend growing? I need the biggest and most healthy you can grow!'

$aramus_win[1] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- I saw her fighting! Just like a beast. I will take her without thinking twice, she will pay for herself very quickly, I’m sure. And here is your Bull Ring, of course. You’ll be happy, pal.'
$wujen_win[1] = '  [Vujin the Wise]<br>- Of course, I saw that race. A very good horse, my dear. More than enough for me, thank you. Here’s your amulet.'
$garsid_win[1] = '  [GARSID]<br>- You ssay that ssshe can do everything? AWESSSOME! Here, take thisss. Thiss isss a Chimaera’ss Gem. Put it in your ear and you will feel true pleasssure. Ssslutss will burssst.'
$magister_vailos_win[1] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- I examined your fiend this morning. I think now is the best stage for my research. And it’s quite healthy. I’m taking it, so here’s your “Raven Crown”, mortal.'
$magister_vailos_quest[1] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- Do you want to serve the Great Knowledge, mortal? Don’t want to, huh… well, of course. Mortals are too busy with their short and hectic life, to think about something really important.'
$magister_vailos_quest[2] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- However, you can still serve it. I’m willing to sweeten the pill to make it worth your while, slaver. Have you ever encountered a Fog fiend?'
$magister_vailos_quest[3] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- I’ve heard that they spoil a lot of blood of people like you. These creatures impregnate a slave somewhere in the fogs, and a few days later, when you’ve already bought her and have big plans… BAM! A larva eats its way out, killing the slave.'
$magister_vailos_quest[4] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- Foolish slavers suffer. Smart ones put it into their service. They catch the larva, put it in the basement, grow it up. Milk it to feed their slaves and not pay for the meals. You’re one of the smart ones, right?'
$magister_vailos_quest[5] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- It would be very helpful for my research to have such a Fog fiend. Alive, healthy and fully developed. Too young or, of course, dead will not work.'
$magister_vailos_quest[6] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- I understand that it is not easy to get such a product and it is not your main profile. But I have something much more valuable than a handful of sparks. I’ve created an artifact that is extremely useful with your work.'
$magister_vailos_quest[7] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- I’ve called it the “Raven Crown”! Once equipped, you will always see the aura of others, and you will discern them better. There is no need to spend time and sparks for magic.'
$magister_vailos_quest[8] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- In addition, it strengthens your aura. Others will perceive your greatness and dignity.'
$magister_vailos_quest[9] = '  [Master Valios]<br>- Just grow the biggest fiend you can grow and bring it to me. I am often on the forum, this is a nice place to think.'

$garsid_quest[1] = '  [GARSID]<br>- Hey, human. Come here. You train whoresss? Yess, human whoresss are good. Soffft and easssily impregnated. They jussst do not know how to fffuck a <i>real</i> man.'
$garsid_quest[2] = '  [GARSID]<br>- I heard that ffor the toughhhest guyss they prepare good whoresss. But they are expensssive. Yess. Very expensssive. Not for usss… And I want to try.'
$garsid_quest[3] = '  [GARSID]<br>- I do not need elite sstufff. Even ifff sshe isss not be able to do anythssing elssse, I do not care. And beauty… I’m not paying for beauty, they all look the sssame.'
$garsid_quest[4] = '  [GARSID]<br>- But sshe mussst fffuck better than anybody. Able to do everythssing! With anyone, anywhere, anytime. In any posssition, in any way. Thisss iss all that mattersss for whoresss, yesss? Sso make sssure ssshe isss good at it.'
$garsid_quest[5] = '  [GARSID]<br>- Give me, give me a perfffect ssex ssslave, and I will give you a charming little thssing. Magical, yesss. You’ll be jussst like me. Not an impotent losser who can only fffuck fffor halfff an hour. You will be able to do thhat indefffinitely. Will nevver get tired, will not get bored.'
$garsid_quest[6] = '  [GARSID]<br>- And sslutsss will feel it. Very much. You will sssquash them with your aura. And woundsss will heal almossst inssstantly in battle. They will not be asss dangerousss.'
$garsid_quest[7] = '  [GARSID]<br>- Nice deal. Rare. No one elssse will. Garssid will. Come to the forum. Bring your whore. We will trade.'
$wujen_quest[1] = '  [Vujin the Wise]<br>- Hello, my dear. Tell me, do you like horse racing? I love races. Those sweaty, glistening bodies, strong muscles and the adrenaline… I must confess that I am a very excitable person. We all have our vices.'
$wujen_quest[2] = '  [Vujin the Wise]<br>- If you only knew how I want to own a horse-champion! But this dream is almost unattainable. They ask for a whole year’s salary just for the champion. And it is very expensive to live in this city.'
$wujen_quest[3] = '  [Vujin the Wise]<br>- However, I can offer something special. A gift for a gift. It’s true, it will not be very appreciated in the Serpis House, but they could pay me better if they want my loyalty, right?'
$wujen_quest[4] = '  [Vujin the Wise]<br>- Our leaders always wear special amulets that increase their concentration and strengthen their personality. And only I know the secret of making these amulets.'
$wujen_quest[5] = '  [Vujin the Wise]<br>- Anyone wearing one of these amulets is very resistant to pain and fear in combat. And everyone around him will see this effect. The aura becomes more powerful and at the same time completely immune to scanning.'
$wujen_quest[6] = '  [Vujin the Wise]<br>- It is impossible to buy this amulet. But I can make one in exchange for a slave that wins the race at the Colosseum. If you decide to go for the trade, find me here on the forum. I often relax here.'
$aramus_quest[1] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- Hey! You. Yes, you. Come over here. I’ve got the offer of the century for you, mutually beneficial for both of us. Interested?'
$aramus_quest[2] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- Listen here. Did you know that the Taurus House conducts closed gladiator fights? Just like in the Colosseum but only for their own. The place is smaller and you can see better. And the owner of the winner wins some serious sparks.'
$aramus_quest[3] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- If I can get a slave who will win a lot… brother, it’s a gold mine! I need a champion of the arena. But of course I don’t have as many sparks as they usually ask for.'
$aramus_quest[4] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- Wait-wait, madam. Do not turn away. You can get sparks anywhere, but my suggestion is unique and you will never come across something quite like this. Yeah. Interested now, aren’t you?'
$aramus_quest[5] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- I have access to special military equipment. Well, you know, there are a lot of demons, undead and these weird heathens with their technical gadgets. We must somehow keep up with their level.'
$aramus_quest[6] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- Get me a slave-champion and I’ll give you a combat artifact called a “Bull Ring”. It’s a normal-looking ring but you’ll be twice as hardy in battle. And as an added bonus, your aura will be stronger.'
$aramus_quest[7] = '  [Sir Aramus]<br>- Think about it. Don’t hurry. If there is a suitable girl, just find me on the forum. I will give you the ring on the same day, all without cheating, do not be afraid. Go now, it’s better if they do not see us together once again.'
!!!!!
$bararaika_quest[1] = '  [Балалайка]
   - У нас проблема, <<$master_name>>. Я совсем забыла про Вайнера, а точнее про его ужасные эксперименты. Мне нужно наглядно доказать Совету, что этот вариант не является альтернативой. Поэтому мне нужна твоя помощь.'
$bararaika_quest[2] = '  [Балалайка]
   - Я хочу, чтобы ты купила у этого сумасшедшего его товар и воспитала из него скот. Я хочу, чтобы Совет посчитал меня беспристрастной в этом вопросе, и трезво прислушался к моей критике.'
$bararaika_quest[3] = '  [Балалайка]
   - Эта скотинка, которую ты мне приведешь, должна быть <font color="#4B0082"><b>жирной, уродливой и безмозглой</b></font>, но отлично <font color="#008000"><b>обученной грязному сексу</b></font> и полностью преданной. Я хочу, чтобы этот отменный товар не вызывал ничего кроме отвращения.'
$bararaika_quest[4] = '  [Балалайка]
   - Займись этим вопросом, дорогуша! Это не должно быть для тебя чем-то экстра ординарным.'
$bararaika_win[1] = '   [Балалайка]
   - Ты справилась, <<$master_name>>! Честно признать я немного сомневалась, но теперь уверенна на 100% что наш план удастся. '
$bararaika_fail[1] = '  [Балалайка]
  - Я не думала что твой потолок так низко. Мне нужен скот Вайнера с хорошей тренировкой и ужасной презентабельностью. А эта тушка никуда не годится! Приведи её в порядок!'
$bararaika_fail_skill_quote['bararaika'] = '   [Балалайка]
   - Ты тренер или кто? Так обучи её должным образом!'
$bararaika_fail_level_quote['bararaika'] = '   [Балалайка]
   - Я не думала что твой потолок так низко. Мне нужна тушка с хорошей тренировкой и ужасной презентабельностью. А эта никуда не годится!'
$bararaika_fail_health_quote['bararaika'] = '   [Балалайка]
   - Она должна была вызывать отвращение а не чувство сострадания, приведи её в порядок и поспеши!'
$bararaika_fail_pregnant_quote['bararaika'] = '   [Балалайка]
   - Я понимаю, что это животное и залететь она может когда угодно. Но сейчас мне такая не нужна.'
$bararaika_fail_again_quote['bararaika'] = '   [Балалайка]
   - Нет, это не то что я хотела, найди другую.'
$bararaika_fail_charm_quote['bararaika'] = '   [Балалайка]
   - Ты издеваешься? Я просила скот Вайнера, а не грязную сучку изображающую животное.'
   
   
